# Handoff keeper bundles: recovery artefacts whose place is the disk, not the
# published repository. Measured (dar-b5pe): 174 tracked bundles / 1.57 GB, six
# to eight rewritten by every handoff, and files above GitHub's 100 MB limit --
# a push of a branch carrying them cannot succeed. The bundles stay on disk;
# only their history inside this repository is under review.
handoff/
source-bundles/
